# Tables - delegated structure; marklower has no pipe syntax.
Tables
description: rows of cells as an omni node; merges via relative pointers
- >
  Marklower has **no table syntax** - no pipe rows, no separator lines. A table is structure, and
  structure is yamlover's job: it is a **body element** tagged `!!<*yamlover: $defs: table>`.
- *: model
- *: cells
- *: merged-cells
- *: header-widths
- *: schema
- *: addressing
